{
    "attributes": {
        "author": [
            "Partner Threat Feed"
        ],
        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Hazel Mortar loader sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01925. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Hazel Mortar Loader: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01925)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Hazel Mortar Loader: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Hazel Mortar loader in campaign PTF-01925.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"8d0a42448e77a53f8bde8c30b58128c3f44985864ec6510c617d1f302a356fb6\", \"dae1a3544e8bb413f7e994a4a7a43563a343e02bc982ef982802528342d307d5\", \"486796a19e631c9770e7c872099f62b9966ee033c5adb68cd1d6ae2592fa4a1d\", \"a97e61c03c9f205087cd3c95786005b418d8338c1fbb9914fb4b0553bde7ecbd\", \"cf2e43d015fac7b40ac2a01ea0bae3920c50f5ec65321b4f395f7b0d892e4765\", \"ff174910977d28243cff9b9d75babe16d5e3dc0272033c9215144d2df68a72fa\", \"77d0b9f1f0ec7b5e2611a7d76a2da26823dd944126c424e4f868e07a0768d6b8\", \"8412d53a6db0f491796f38eb360184a694a942949d256e3b4c1eda9c9365e988\")",
        "references": [
